"We Make Commons" is a campaign site making the case for public investment in digital commons — the shared, open source infrastructure that increasingly underpins public services. Built with Astro, it is part of ongoing advocacy work to get digital commons recognised and funded as public-interest infrastructure at the French and EU level.
